WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:11.250
Edit your current data in Excel and import it back to update records, see exactly what changes, then undo an import from the history.

2
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:16.130
To change many records at once, start from your current data.

3
00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:22.700
With current data downloads every brand in the template. Change what you need in Excel.

4
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:28.340
Then upload it. Here, two brands have a new website.

5
00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:35.440
Rows that match a brand already here are updates; the rest are unchanged and left alone.

6
00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:40.620
Each update shows what the field was and what it becomes.

7
00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:43.840
Import the changes.

8
00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:48.620
All imports keeps every batch: what, which file, who and when.

9
00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:53.460
Open one to see what it added and changed.

10
00:00:53.460 --> 00:01:00.820
Undo puts updated records back as they were and removes new ones, unless something already uses them.

11
00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:04.340
Confirm, and the import is undone.

12
00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:08.610
The record of the import stays, marked as undone.
